AIGMos help index for the current code snapshot.

Primary documentation files:
- README.md
- docs/README.md
- docs/help/HELP_OVERVIEW.md
- docs/help/COMMAND_SURFACE.md
- docs/help/LAYOUTS_AND_HELP.md
- docs/help/Q_AND_QC.md
- docs/help/TROUBLESHOOTING.md

Runtime-side help files:
- system/library/help/index.md
- system/library/help/current_snapshot.md
- system/library/layout/help.tmpl

Current important command forms:
- new -> new |<instance> /<module-or-layout>
- q -> q[.profile] <prompt...>
- qc -> qc[.profile] <output> <prompt...>
- run -> run <command|&source>
- trig -> trig !name <expr> | trig !name onchange <ref> | trig !name cron "spec"
- on -> on !trigger @event "command"
- bind -> bind alt-1..alt-9|alt-0 <command...>
- unbind -> unbind alt-1..alt-9|alt-0
- binds -> binds
- ls -> ls [target|prefix*]
- cat -> cat <target>
- mk -> mk <target>
- set -> set <symbol> <value>
- add -> add <target> <source>
- cp -> cp <src> <dst>
- mv -> mv <src> <dst>
- rm -> rm <target>
- import.file -> import.file <src> <target>
- import.json -> import.json <input> <output>
- import.code -> import.code <src> <dst>
- export.file -> export.file <src> <dst>
- export.json -> export.json <src> <dst>
- export.code -> export.code <src> <dst>
- map.structure -> map.structure #input [$output]
- map.files -> map.files #input [$output]
- hget -> hget <output> <url|symbol>
- hpost -> hpost <output> <url|symbol> <raw-body...>

Slash commands:
- /help [/cmd]
- /time
- /greeting
- /clear
- /reload [...]
- /health q[.alias]
- /exit
- /cs
- /q
- /monitor[.alias]

Current help/layout rules:
- |instance is the layout identity
- <layout title="..."> is the default display title
- label input="|:title" reads the instance display title
- help layout is created with: new |HELP /help
- qmon is read-only q monitoring for another q-capable instance

If an older canonical/spec file conflicts with the current code snapshot, explain the current code snapshot first.
